  aciklama:
  - "At\u0131m\u0131 ald\u0131n demek..."
  - "Demek at\u0131m\u0131 yedin..."
  - "At\u0131m tehlikede miydi? Fark etmemi\u015Fim... <sprite=33>"
  - "At\u0131m\u0131 yedin {{isim}}... \u015Eimdi g\xF6r\xFCrs\xFCn sen!"
  - "At\u0131m\u0131 alarak ak\u0131ll\u0131ca davrand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 m\u0131
    san\u0131yorsun {{isim}}? \u015Eimdi g\xF6rece\u011Fiz!"
  - "\u0130yi hamle ama ben ats\u0131z da yapabilirim. \u015Eimdi g\xF6sterece\u011Fim
    sana bunu!"
  - "At\u0131m gitti, eyvah! <sprite=36>"
  - "O ouuu... At\u0131m\u0131 ne ara yedin sen? G\xF6rmemi\u015Fim, t\xFCh!"
  - "At\u0131m\u0131 ald\u0131n, ben de senin akl\u0131n\u0131 alaca\u011F\u0131m!"
  - "Bir at\u0131n senin i\xE7in laf\u0131 olmaz {{isim}}, al bakal\u0131m..."
  - "At\u0131 sana kas\u0131tl\u0131 vermedi\u011Fimi nereden biliyorsun? <sprite=7>"
  - Beygirimi yedin!
  - "Gitti {{data, renksec=beyaz, kara ya\u011F\u0131z | renksec=siyah, bembeyaz}}
    k\xFCheylan\u0131m. Vahh!"
  - "\u0130ster at\u0131m\u0131, ister kat\u0131m\u0131, ister yat\u0131m\u0131 al.
    Kral\u0131m\u0131 yedirtmem! <sprite=84>"
